B.F8=A.b(s(["Traveller... you carry the resonance of one who seeks. We have waited ten thousand years for such a signal.","We are the Aetherians. Not extinct \u2014 transformed. Our consciousness lives within Gaia's neural lattice.","Help Gaia remember us. A civilization that chose harmony over conquest must not be forgotten."]),t.s)
