B.DY=A.b(s(["The Core Record lies below us. Gaia's first memory \u2014 the moment we chose to merge our consciousness with this world.","Commander Voss seeks to delete it. Without that memory, Gaia loses herself. The planet dies. We die again.","Your neural signature matches the Aetherian activation code, Kaela. Only you can protect the Core."]),t.s)
